      "description": "The size of the objects that moved — GetObject, PutObject, UploadPart, PostObject — on an octave grid of 1 KiB … 1 TiB (РS7). The aws-chunked framing is discounted (РS6), so this follows the objects and not the client's buffer size; a listing's XML and an error document are payload but not objects, and are not in here."
